# Blocks of six code lines or more that stand in more than one place
# (tests/structural/block.rs, the ruling of 2026-11-24: duplication is a
# defect, and a part does one job and nothing else). One group per run,
# however long the run: a group that is another group sliding is not
# counted. A copy made can raise the count and a copy removed can lower it,
# and either way the run fails, so this file says what is left to do. The
# count is of groups and not of copies: taking one copy out of a group of
# four leaves the group, so work can land here and move nothing (2026-11-27,
# the facet's interner leaving the `self.words` group of four).
#
# 85 when the scan landed (2026-11-24). 78 on 2026-11-25: the facet built
# four ways in phiecs storage is `Storage::facet` over an `IntoPhasor`
# phasor, the source file read three ways in phient is `sources::text`, and
# the repack on the real axis six families each had is `family::scalar`
# with `family::truth` beside it.
#
# 76 later the same day: the two `Ref` bodies nothing writes any more are
# gone and the three it reads are one `Body<P>`, the bytes held in place by
# `the_written_bytes_are_the_format`.
#
# 68 on 2026-11-27, from one dedup: philog's engine walk, its walk under
# an effort limit and its walk swept from a sector were three copies of
# one walk, differing in where they aim and the words they say themselves
# in - `walk::walk` over a `walk::Aim`, with five tests where the crate
# had none for it. Eight groups, not the one the TODO named: the step
# told and then recorded, the candidate sort, the fold to the shorter way
# round the circle and the answer built from the words went with it.
#
# 66 the same day: the v1 and v2 bodies said the same five string-keyed
# fields twice and the loader spread them out at both call sites - one
# `StringKeyed`, handed to `from_string_keyed` whole. v2's
# `#[serde(default)]` went with its copy: bincode is positional and reads
# every field in order, so it had never fired.
#
# 65 the same day: phient's two context constructions were one sum
# written twice, in one file - the words summed into the channels and
# each channel normalised back to the unit circle. They differ only in
# what a word brings to the sum (`Brought`: a share of its amplitude, or
# a roll by the golden angle for its place). The test that went with it
# found the file's own claim wrong: the weighted construction was
# documented as order-blind and reads 0.453, not 1.0, because the
# normalisation keeps a direction the heavier word turns.
#
# 65 holds on 2026-11-27 while a copy goes: the crate interned words twice,
# here for the ECS over an opaque `Word` and in `phasor::facet` over the
# `u32` the file format stores. One `Lexicon<I: Id>` now, `Vocab` an alias
# over it; the facet's copy of `len`/`is_empty` left a group of four that
# three types still stand in. 152 phiecs tests, the format pin among them.
#
# 64 the same day: five of phical's six families each wrote out the row
# literal that builds one Operator, differing in the family they named and
# nothing else. `family::row` builds it and each family binds its own name
# in a line. 124 tests, the index bijection over all 64 operators among
# them. Two groups the scan still names are not defects: a parameter list
# repeated by a wrapper that binds one argument (phient's `cycle` over
# `cycle_with`) is how Rust spells a default, and the accessors two types
# write for one trait are what a trait impl is.
64
